    <string name="about_legal">Ticker is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or (at your option) any later version. Ticker comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY; see the licence below for details.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Rates are reference rates, shown for information only. They are not the rates a bank, card or exchange will give you, and they can be out of date or wrong. The card fee is an estimate. Nothing in Ticker is financial advice; check the real rate before you pay.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">No account, ads, analytics or tracking. Camera images are read on the phone and never stored or sent. The app only downloads public exchange rates; those servers see your IP address.</string>
    <string name="about_source_ecb_detail">Euro foreign exchange reference rates (source: ECB), fetched through Frankfurter. Cross rates, daily changes and charts are Ticker\'s own calculations from these rates, not ECB figures.</string>
    <string name="about_source_fawaz_detail">Other currencies and all crypto prices, updated once a day. Public domain (CC0).</string>

